  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Conoces a Skarmory, el Pokémon Coraza Ave?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0043006F006E006F0063006500730020006100200053006B00610072006D006F00720079002C00200065006C00200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E00200043006F00720061007A00610020004100760065003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Las plumas que se le caen son tan finas y afiladas\nque antes se solían usar para hacer espadas.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nHoy en día, incluso, se siguen usando para\nhacer cuchillos de cocina.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 173
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Conozco a un prestigioso chef al que le vendría\nmuy bien uno de esos cuchillos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPor eso estoy intentando conseguir una pluma\nde Skarmory.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 145
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tú estás compitiendo en los Juegos Z-A, ¿no?\nProbablemente, no te cueste nada encontrar una.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lo malo es que los Skarmory están ahí, en la\nzona salvaje 17, que está llena de Pokémon<U+0010><U+0001>븀\naterradores.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 108
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como eres tan fuerte, quería pedirte que\nme ayudes a conseguir la pluma...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por favor, consígueme una pluma de uno de\nlos Skarmory en la zona salvaje 17.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Es una pluma de Skarmory!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10045007300200075006E006100200070006C0075006D006100200064006500200053006B00610072006D006F0072007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, es una garra de Skarmory, no una pluma.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C00200065007300200075006E006100200067006100720072006100200064006500200053006B00610072006D006F00720079002C0020006E006F00200075006E006100200070006C0075006D0061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué lástima, es solo ceniza de un Lampent.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500E90020006C00E1007300740069006D0061002C00200065007300200073006F006C006F002000630065006E0069007A006100200064006500200075006E0020004C0061006D00700065006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No es más que un fragmento de metal\nde una de las llaves de un Klefki.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F0020006500730020006D00E10073002000710075006500200075006E00200066007200610067006D0065006E0074006F0020006400650020006D006500740061006C000A0064006500200075006E00610020006400650020006C006100730020006C006C006100760065007300200064006500200075006E0020004B006C00650066006B0069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Solo era una bola de pelo de Diggersby.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053006F006C006F002000650072006100200075006E006100200062006F006C0061002000640065002000700065006C006F0020006400650020004400690067006700650072007300620079002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, no, es un fragmento de espina de un Chespin.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006E006F002C00200065007300200075006E00200066007200610067006D0065006E0074006F00200064006500200065007300700069006E006100200064006500200075006E0020004300680065007300700069006E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, resulta que era pelo de la melena\nde un Pyroar hembra.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002C00200072006500730075006C0074006100200071007500650020006500720061002000700065006C006F0020006400650020006C00610020006D0065006C0065006E0061000A0064006500200075006E0020005000790072006F00610072002000680065006D006200720061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ay, resulta que era pelo de la melena\nde un Pyroar macho.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410079002C00200072006500730075006C0074006100200071007500650020006500720061002000700065006C006F0020006400650020006C00610020006D0065006C0065006E0061000A0064006500200075006E0020005000790072006F006100720020006D006100630068006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era solo una piedrita que brilla.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450072006100200073006F006C006F00200075006E006100200070006900650064007200690074006100200071007500650020006200720069006C006C0061002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era una simple piedrita brillante.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450072006100200075006E0061002000730069006D0070006C00650020007000690065006400720069007400610020006200720069006C006C0061006E00740065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Era una lentejuela de algún vestido.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450072006100200075006E00610020006C0065006E00740065006A00750065006C006100200064006500200061006C006700FA006E0020007600650073007400690064006F002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Supuse que a estas alturas ya deberías haber\nencontrado una pluma, así que esquivé a<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nlos Pyroar como pude y vine a buscarte.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Esa pluma es ideal para hacer un cuchillo!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 179
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Skaaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006B006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡¿Eh?! ¡¿Qué pasa?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100BF00450068003F0021002000A100BF0051007500E900200070006100730061003F0021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Rápido, tienes que ahuyentar a ese Skarmory!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005200E1007000690064006F002C0020007400690065006E006500730020007100750065002000610068007500790065006E00740061007200200061002000650073006500200053006B00610072006D006F007200790021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Skaaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006B006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Uf... ¿Por qué nos habrá atacado el Skarmory así\nde repente?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00550066002E002E002E002000BF0050006F007200200071007500E90020006E006F00730020006800610062007200E10020006100740061006300610064006F00200065006C00200053006B00610072006D006F0072007900200061007300ED000A0064006500200072006500700065006E00740065003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Skaaar!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006B006100610061007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Acaso la pluma es algo muy valioso para ti\ny por eso te enojaste?<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡También es algo muy valioso para mí!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 112
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quiero hacer un cuchillo de cocina para\nregalárselo a un chef que conozco.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tanto las personas como los Pokémon que viven\nen esta ciudad adoran sus platillos.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Todo lo que cocina es una delicia!\nDéjame que me quede con la pluma, por favor.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 171
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Karm!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004B00610072006D00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Entonces... ¡¿me la puedo quedar?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E0074006F006E006300650073002E002E002E002000A100BF006D00650020006C006100200070007500650064006F0020007100750065006400610072003F0021001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mory!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4416,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006F0072007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Muchas gracias! Le contaré al chef que me\nayudaste mucho.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D007500630068006100730020006700720061006300690061007300210020004C006500200063006F006E00740061007200E900200061006C0020006300680065006600200071007500650020006D0065000A006100790075006400610073007400650020006D007500630068006F002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Visita el Restaurante Ulalá para probar los platillos\nque prepare el chef con su nuevo cuchillo.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n¡Seguro te van a gustar!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Mory!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D006F0072007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Espero que el Skarmory haya entendido lo que\ntrataba de decirle.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4836,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007000650072006F002000710075006500200065006C00200053006B00610072006D006F007200790020006800610079006100200065006E00740065006E006400690064006F0020006C006F0020007100750065000A0074007200610074006100620061002000640065002000640065006300690072006C0065002E001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Claro que sí",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006C00610072006F00200071007500650020007300ED0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Seguro va a ir al restaurante",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00530065006700750072006F0020007600610020006100200069007200200061006C002000720065007300740061007500720061006E007400650000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je, je... Creo que acabo de hacerme amigo de un\nPokémon salvaje. ¡Quién lo hubiera imaginado!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 5064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿*",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 5260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF002A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias a ti conseguí algo más valioso que\nel mejor cuchillo del mundo.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 5272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Skarmory!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10053006B00610072006D006F0072007900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    }
